@@ -21,6 +21,13 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Commands
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar` without arguments for the list of commands, or `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the usage of a specific command.
+
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or updates a Sokrates landscape report, aggregating results of multiple analyses found under an analysis root (e.g. `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>`). Same as `updateLandscape`, which is kept for backward compatibility.
+* `updateLandscape`: the same command as `analyzeLandscape`, kept so that existing scripts keep working.
+
